WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.887
Reading files is one place where Spark-specific code is very visible.

00:00:04.887 --> 00:00:12.087
Spark can read C S V files, Parquet files, Delta data, and other formats.

00:00:12.087 --> 00:00:16.652
The exact read command depends on the format and environment.

00:00:16.652 --> 00:00:24.527
After the file has been loaded into a data frame or a table, the relational logic becomes much more familiar.

00:00:24.527 --> 00:00:28.907
We can filter, join, group, reshape, and validate the data.

00:00:28.907 --> 00:00:33.967
Keep the two stages separate in your mind.

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:38.372
File ingestion brings the data into the processing environment.

00:00:38.372 --> 00:00:42.899
S Q L and data-frame transformations prepare it for analysis.
